NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1238174682,"text":"Wait, calm down for a second, Cosanzeana. Let's think of another solution together. First off, why would the Breacher Primus damage your flower garden?","nextNodeIds":[740490205,740490206]},{"nodeId":740490205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3864908354,"text":"When you brought other flowers back before...","nextNodeIds":[740490207]},{"nodeId":740490207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5315,"speakerName":"Cosanzeana","textMapHash":1057340098,"text":"No, never! Hmph, that bad guy would only dare do such things behind my back. Ooh, now I'm really mad!","nextNodeIds":[740490208]},{"nodeId":740490208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1775156490,"text":"Wow, uh, Paimon didn't expect Cosanzeana could also get so angry. Guess she really does care a lot about these flowers.","nextNodeIds":[740490209]},{"nodeId":740490209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1649329890,"text":"But thinking back for a moment, it's not like the Primuses ran away once she got close...","nextNodeIds":[740490210]},{"nodeId":740490210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1361963002,"text":"Perhaps it's not the flowers that are attracting them.","nextNodeIds":[740490211]},{"nodeId":740490211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3781700954,"text":"That's possible. Let's check the area around the garden and see what we can find!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":740490206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2782273818,"text":"Did any Breacher Primuses come after you?","nextNodeIds":[740490207]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7404902,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond